# the syllogism and its fallacy, as a model might write them
atom	audited(x)	x was audited
atom	safe(x)	x is safe
atom	android	the client is an Android app
atom	ordered	the build was ordered
P1	S1	∀x. audited(x) → safe(x)
P2	S2	audited(web1) ∧ ¬ordered
P3	S3	android implies (ordered or not ordered)
C	S4	safe(web1) and not ordered
